      "text": "An instruction pipeline has ﬁve stages where each stage take 2 nanoseconds and all instruction use all ﬁve stages. Branch instructions are not overlapped. i.e., the instruction after the branch is not fetched till the branch instruction is completed. Under ideal conditions,",
